OL,5,G1300 Guy Garvey's Finest Hour
OL,6,     FGuy celebrates Slow Sunday with a
OL,7,     Fselection of tunes so slow they
OL,8,     Factually stop. Also, a chat with
OL,9,     FMax Pope and Vincent Neff.
OL,10,G1600 Jarvis Cocker
OL,11,     FJarvis takes us on a journey to
OL,12,     Fthe New England coast courtesy of
OL,13,     Fauthor Elizabeth Strout. There's
OL,14,     Falso a little Venetian soundscape
OL,15,     Fto keep the mellow vibes flowing.
OL,16,G1800 Mary Anne Hobbs
OL,17,     FNorwegian Mexican artist and DJ
OL,18,     FCarmen Villain provides an ambient
OL,19,     Fmix for Slow Sunday and Marina
OL,20,     FHerlop selects her choice for our
OL,21,     FEnd of Days music library.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
